                            	  5835:     ; This segment is dead. We'll swap the tail segment with this
                            	  5836:     ; dead segment. This way, moldorm heads are always rooted
                            	  5837:     ; in slots 5 and $A; and the segments are continguous.
                            	  5838:     ;
