                            	  8469: ; Description:
                            	  8470: ; Blue Wizzrobe has two states: walking and teleporting.
                            	  8471: ; When walking, the object timer is set. When teleporting,
                            	  8472: ; the teleporting distance remaining is set.
                            	  8473: ;
                            	  8474: ; If we have the magic clock, then only go draw and check collisions.
                            	  8475: ;
