                            	  1706:     ; CurRow to zero. Otherwise it would be $FF.
                            	  1707:     ; A positive value triggers this submode 1 to transfer
                            	  1708:     ; the whole play area.
                            	  1709:     ;
                            	  1710:     ; But why? As far as I can tell, the NT 0 is already in
                            	  1711:     ; a good state reflecting the new room. The only thing
                            	  1712:     ; needed is possibly to brighten the room by way of
                            	  1713:     ; changing the palette.
                            	  1714:     ;
                            	  1715:     ; So why does mode 7 trigger this?
