                            	  4288: Link_ModifyDirInDoorway:
                            	  4289:     ; In a doorway (UW), you can only move in the direction
                            	  4290:     ; that you entered it or the opposite.
                            	  4291:     ;
                            	  4292:     ;
                            	  4293:     ; If not in a doorway nor moving, then return.
