                            	  8336: __far_z_05_0112:
                            	  8337:     ; Shift right. The value in A is now (menu scroll value) / 2,
                            	  8338:     ; and represents the current row of the submenu being processed.
                            	  8339:     ; The bottom bit tells us (1) whether to transfer a full row of
                            	  8340:     ; black tiles, or (0) a row of the triforce or other piece of the GUI.
